they could even paint, and they can, and you can.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:40.970
You really can do this.

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.280
We show you everything that you need here

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:49.840
to do fantastic paintings, absolutely fantastic paintings.

